135100         MULTIPLY 1440 BY JUL-DAY-SAVE.
135200     MULTIPLY 60 BY TIME-RECD-HH GIVING TRECD-MIN.
135300     ADD TIME-RECD-MM TO TRECD-MIN.
135400     MULTIPLY 60 BY TIME-COMP-HH GIVING TCOMP-MIN.
135500     ADD TIME-COMP-MM TO TCOMP-MIN.
